    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d975">

                <pb facs="0757" n="675" xml:id="pg675"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chief
                    Justice.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-06-13"><hi rendition="#italic">June 13,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: At the request of Señor Don Joaquín
                    Bernardo Calvo, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of Costa Rica,
                    and of Dr. Belisario Porras, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of
                    Panama, I have the honor to transmit to you herewith a joint note<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d975-f1"/> addressed to you in which they request you to accept the
                    office of arbitrator of the boundary dispute between their respective
                    countries.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">P. C. Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
